room zone1/11_ember_toss_cancel
# Zone 1, room 11: tech 11, Ember-toss cancel (BUILD.md s5: "throw the ember mid-dash, teleport
# after landing. Taught by a chasm"; s6 Ember Toss: 600 u/s, 3 f startup, 6 f invulnerable; ADR-0010).
# Grey box, not art.
#
# The first encounter is safe: a dip 4 tiles (128 u) wide and 2 tiles (64 u) deep, 54 u from the
# door. Falling in costs nothing (a jump climbs out); an ember thrown across it flies 400 u (40 f
# at 10 u/f) and a teleport puts the body on the far lip, so the toss is met before it is needed.
#
# Then the chasm: 75 tiles (2400 u) from the near edge at 480 u to the far face at 2880 u, over a
# pit 192 u below the ledges (row 18; falling in is a hazard that sends Ash back to the arrival
# point). The far face is smooth above the pit, so nothing in the gap can be clung to, pogoed off
# or climbed. The only way across is a dash-jump with the Ember Toss thrown mid-dash:
#   - the farthest route with a dash-jump and no toss (a ground dash, the jump on dash frame 7,
#     the air jump, the air dash up-right) carries the body 2243 u past the edge;
#   - the same route with one Ember Toss, thrown up-right on frame 6 of the air dash (the dash
#     carries on: the toss never cancels it) and teleported to 36 ticks later, carries it 2505 u;
#   - a crossing needs a reach past 2390 u (the gap less half the body's width), so 147 u more
#     than any route without the toss reaches and 115 u less than the toss route reaches. Routes
#     with a toss but no dash-jump reach 1592 u at most (ADR-0010), a plain throw from the edge
#     400 u (tests/replay/zone1/11_*).
#   tools/replay/gap_reach.gd measures this on test/longchasm, the near half of this chasm with
#   no far side (tests/unit/tools/test_gap_reach_room.gd keeps the two the same).
# The room is 105 x 20 tiles, not 60 x 34: the tech needs a chasm 75 tiles wide, and the ceiling
# 12 tiles above the ledge is part of what was measured.
# About 8 s for a skilled player: 3 s of run-up and dash, 4 s of airtime across the chasm.
size 105 20
spawn 74 384
tiles
